{"seq":1,"slug":"old-item-haul-away","title":"旧物回收（haul-away）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/haulaway-damage-exception/old-item-haul-away","wordCount":1872,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"旧物回收-haul-away\">旧物回收（haul-away）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「把旧的带走」看起来是一次顺手服务，实际上是三条不同性质的工作被压在同一个动作里：<strong>物流作业</strong>（把旧件从客户家里搬出来、装车）、<strong>逆向库存</strong>（旧件去哪、能不能二次利用）、<strong>合规处置</strong>（旧家电属于受管制的废弃物流，处置主体与凭证有法定要求）。这三条如果只做第一条，会留下一个真实的风险敞口——平台把受管制的废弃物交给了没有处置资质的一方。</p>\n<p>工程上正确的定位是：haul-away 不是派送单的一个附属标志位，而是一张<strong>独立的、与派送单关联但生命周期不同的单子</strong>。它与主派送单的关系是「同车执行、独立追踪、独立合规」，这三点必须同时在数据模型里表达。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Order[主订单] --&gt; HA{客户是否选择回收}&#10;  HA --&gt;|否| Delivery[仅派送]&#10;  HA --&gt;|是| HAOrder[创建回收单]&#10;  HAOrder --&gt; Eligibility[可回收性判定: 品类/尺寸/是否有害]&#10;  Eligibility --&gt;|合规可收| Schedule[与派送同时段排入]&#10;  Eligibility --&gt;|不可收| Reject[告知客户 + 就近回收点指引]&#10;  Schedule --&gt; SameVan[同车执行]&#10;  SameVan --&gt; Pickup[取出旧件 + 拍照]&#10;  Pickup --&gt; Transport[运回本地仓回收区]&#10;  Transport --&gt; Sort{分类}&#10;  Sort --&gt;|可再利用| Refurb[翻新/二手渠道]&#10;  Sort --&gt;|WEEE 类| WEEE[合规处置 + 凭证]&#10;  Sort --&gt;|大件垃圾| Bulk[本地大件垃圾流程]\">graph TD\n  Order[主订单] --&gt; HA{客户是否选择回收}\n  HA --&gt;|否| Delivery[仅派送]\n  HA --&gt;|是| HAOrder[创建回收单]\n  HAOrder --&gt; Eligibility[可回收性判定: 品类/尺寸/是否有害]\n  Eligibility --&gt;|合规可收| Schedule[与派送同时段排入]\n  Eligibility --&gt;|不可收| Reject[告知客户 + 就近回收点指引]\n  Schedule --&gt; SameVan[同车执行]\n  SameVan --&gt; Pickup[取出旧件 + 拍照]\n  Pickup --&gt; Transport[运回本地仓回收区]\n  Transport --&gt; Sort{分类}\n  Sort --&gt;|可再利用| Refurb[翻新/二手渠道]\n  Sort --&gt;|WEEE 类| WEEE[合规处置 + 凭证]\n  Sort --&gt;|大件垃圾| Bulk[本地大件垃圾流程]</pre><h2 id=\"可回收性判定\">可回收性判定</h2><h3 id=\"三个判定维度\">三个判定维度</h3><p>并非所有旧物都能收。判定要在<strong>下单时</strong>完成，因为事后拒绝会把「一次上门」变成「两次上门」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>判定后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品类</td>\n<td>是否属于可回收清单</td>\n<td>不在清单内 → 不可收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺寸与重量</td>\n<td>是否超出同车剩余容积/载重</td>\n<td>超出 → 改约专车或拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有害与管制</td>\n<td>是否属于需专门处置的类别</td>\n<td>属于 → 必须走持证渠道，否则拒收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三项是最容易被忽略、后果最严重的一项。旧家电（含制冷剂的冰箱、含压缩机的空调）在不同法域下都属于受管制的废弃物，处置与回收有法定主体要求，不能作为普通废品处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"监管框架的两个实例\">监管框架的两个实例</h3><p>以欧盟为例，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=uriserv:OJ.L_.2012.197.01.0038.01.ENG\">Directive 2012/19/EU</a>（WEEE 指令）Article 5 规定了分类收集义务，其中 Article 5(2)(b) 要求经销商在供应新产品时允许客户免费退回对应的旧设备「on a one-to-one basis」，且旧设备须为「of equivalent type and has fulfilled the same functions」；Article 5(2)(c) 则要求销售面积达到一定规模（该条明文为「sales areas relating to EEE of at least 400 m²」）的经销商对其店铺或其附近回收「very small WEEE（无外部尺寸超过 25 cm）」，且<strong>不要求购买等价产品</strong>。这两条的差别很有意思：大件的「以旧换新式」回收是随购买发生的，小件的回收则与购买解耦；大件送装场景落在前者的范围里，这正好解释了为什么 haul-away 在产品设计上天然与「买新的」绑定。</p>\n<p>美国的框架不同，倾向于按州与地方立法，且对含制冷剂设备的处置有技术性约束：处理这类设备前必须回收制冷剂，而该作业要求人员按 <a href=\"https://www.epa.gov/section608\">40 CFR Part 82 Subpart F</a> 取得 Section 608 认证。这意味着回收商的选择不是「便宜就好」，而是一个必须验证资质的采购决策。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定结果的表达\">判定结果的表达</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;haulaway_order_id&quot;: &quot;HA-2026-1005-3311&quot;,&#10;  &quot;linked_delivery_id&quot;: &quot;DO-2026-1005-8842&quot;,&#10;  &quot;item&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;category&quot;: &quot;refrigerator&quot;,&#10;    &quot;approx_dims_cm&quot;: { &quot;l&quot;: 70, &quot;w&quot;: 68, &quot;h&quot;: 175 },&#10;    &quot;refrigerant_present&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;refrigerant_type&quot;: &quot;R600a&quot;,&#10;    &quot;hazardous_handling_required&quot;: true&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;eligibility&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;category_allowed&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;fits_van_remaining&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;requires_certified_disposal&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;verdict&quot;: &quot;accepted_with_compliance&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;execution&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;same_van&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;crew_must_be_trained&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;photo_required&quot;: [&quot;before_removal&quot;, &quot;loaded&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"haulaway_order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HA-2026-1005-3311\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"linked_delivery_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DO-2026-1005-8842\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refrigerator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"approx_dims_cm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"l\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">68</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">175</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"refrigerant_present\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"refrigerant_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"R600a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"hazardous_handling_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"eligibility\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"category_allowed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fits_van_remaining\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"requires_certified_disposal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"verdict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accepted_with_compliance\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"execution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"same_van\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"crew_must_be_trained\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"photo_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"before_removal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"loaded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>requires_certified_disposal</code> 是这张单子与普通派送单最本质的差别：它把一个合规义务挂在了单子上，而合规义务必须有<strong>承接主体</strong>与<strong>凭证</strong>。第 4.2 篇（<a href=\"../haulaway-damage-exception/delivery-damage-install-fail\">破损与安装失败处置</a>）的异常单里会把「合规凭证缺失」作为一种异常类型处理，因为一旦发生，它是无法通过补一次上门补救的。含制冷剂设备的回收还牵出另一条资格链：处置前的制冷剂回收作业要求人员持证，这与第 3.2 篇（<a href=\"../assembly-install-service/installer-skill-cert-route\">安装工技能/认证与派单</a>）讨论的资质约束是同一类问题，只是发生在逆向端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同车执行的约束\">同车执行的约束</h2><h3 id=\"容积与载重的双向占用\">容积与载重的双向占用</h3><p>同车执行不是免费的：出去时载的是新货，回来时载的是旧件，车辆的容积与载重在<strong>两段行程中分别被占用</strong>。这带来一个常见的规划错误——只按去程算装载。正确的算法是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可行</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>η</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可行} \\iff V_{new} + V_{old} \\le V_{van} \\cdot \\eta \\quad \\wedge \\quad w_{new} + w_{old} \\le W_{van}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可行</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是装载率上限（受装卸便利性约束，通常小于 1）。若去程已经接近满载，回收件就只能等在返程单独拉，或者干脆拒绝。这就是为什么可回收性判定必须知道<strong>同车去程的装载情况</strong>——它需要在派单时才能最终确认，而不是在下单时。</p>\n<h3 id=\"作业顺序\">作业顺序</h3><p>旧件是「先取出、后装入」还是「先装入、后取出」，取决于两者是否在同一位置。通常的顺序是：先把新货搬入到位（这样空出的搬运通道可以复用给旧件），再把旧件搬出装车。若旧件位于新货要摆放的位置（例如换冰箱），顺序必须反过来：先搬出旧件腾出位置。这个次序在系统上应当作为工单的一个步骤提示，因为顺序错误会导致「新货挡住了旧货出门的路」这种需要反复挪动的低效作业。</p>\n<h3 id=\"卫生与污染\">卫生与污染</h3><p>旧家电内部可能残留食物、水或灰尘。回收作业应带基本的清理与包裹（旧冰箱需要固定门体、旧洗衣机需要排空残水），否则会在车厢里留下污染，影响后续订单的商品卫生。这属于作业规范而非系统设计，但它应当在单子上有对应的检查项：<code>residual_drained</code>、<code>door_secured</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逆向去向与凭证\">逆向去向与凭证</h2><h3 id=\"三条去向\">三条去向</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>去向</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>记录要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>翻新/二手</td>\n<td>功能完好、外观可接受</td>\n<td>检测结论、流向渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受管制废弃物处置</td>\n<td>WEEE 类或含制冷剂设备</td>\n<td>处置方资质、凭证编号、处置日期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地大件垃圾</td>\n<td>不属于受管制类别</td>\n<td>清运记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"凭证为什么必须结构化存储\">凭证为什么必须结构化存储</h3><p>处置凭证是合规审查时的唯一证据，且它有<strong>保存期限</strong>（不同法域的保存年限不同）。因此凭证不能是一张存在共享盘里的 PDF，而应当是带编号、日期、接收方与有效期的主体记录，可被查询与导出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE haulaway_disposal_certificate (&#10;  certificate_id   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  haulaway_order_id TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES haulaway_order(haulaway_order_id),&#10;  disposal_party_id TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  party_license_no  TEXT,&#10;  certificate_no    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  issued_on         DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  category          TEXT NOT NULL,       -- weee_refrigerant / weee_general / bulk_waste&#10;  weight_kg         NUMERIC(8,2),&#10;  retain_until      DATE NOT NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> haulaway_disposal_certificate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certificate_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  haulaway_order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> haulaway_order(haulaway_order_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  disposal_party_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  party_license_no  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certificate_no    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issued_on         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- weee_refrigerant / weee_general / bulk_waste</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  weight_kg         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retain_until      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>retain_until</code> 是一个容易被省略但很关键的字段：它把「保存多久」变成一条可查询的规则，从而可以做出「本季度有多少凭证即将到期」这类运营动作，而不是等到审计时才发现凭证散落各处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>haul-away 是物流作业、逆向库存、合规处置三件事的叠加，必须是独立单子，与主派送单「同车执行、独立追踪、独立合规」。</li>\n<li>可回收性判定要在下单时完成，判定维度是品类、尺寸重量、有害与管制三项；含制冷剂设备属于受管制类别，处置必须走持证渠道。</li>\n<li>欧盟 WEEE 指令 Article 5(2)(b) 的「以旧换新式」一对一回收与 Article 5(2)(c) 的小件无条件回收是两种不同义务，大件送装场景落在前者。</li>\n<li>同车执行的可行性要按去程与返程分别校验容积与载重之和，作业顺序取决于旧件是否占用了新货的目标位置。</li>\n<li>处置凭证必须结构化存储（编号、日期、接收方、类别、保存期限），因为它是合规审查的唯一证据且保存期有限。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"旧物回收（haul-away）","id":"旧物回收-haul-away"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可回收性判定","id":"可回收性判定"},{"level":3,"text":"三个判定维度","id":"三个判定维度"},{"level":3,"text":"监管框架的两个实例","id":"监管框架的两个实例"},{"level":3,"text":"判定结果的表达","id":"判定结果的表达"},{"level":2,"text":"同车执行的约束","id":"同车执行的约束"},{"level":3,"text":"容积与载重的双向占用","id":"容积与载重的双向占用"},{"level":3,"text":"作业顺序","id":"作业顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"卫生与污染","id":"卫生与污染"},{"level":2,"text":"逆向去向与凭证","id":"逆向去向与凭证"},{"level":3,"text":"三条去向","id":"三条去向"},{"level":3,"text":"凭证为什么必须结构化存储","id":"凭证为什么必须结构化存储"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"安装质检与客户签收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/assembly-install-service/install-quality-verify-signoff"},"next":{"title":"破损与安装失败处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/haulaway-damage-exception/delivery-damage-install-fail"}}